# Data & large artifacts — NEVER commit scientific data.
# Mirrors v2.0/.gitignore but anchored at the repo root, because some
# download scripts resolve relative --out-dir against the session cwd and
# can drop files in the root-level data/ directory (see docs/data_download.md).
/data/
/outputs/
/runs/
/*.nc
/*.mat
/*.zarr/
/*.h5